  "goodToKnow": "Die Unterschicht is the lower class or underclass in sociology: Oberschicht, Mittelschicht, Unterschicht. In 2006 a debate about a neues Prekariat and the word Unterschicht caused controversy, and many prefer neutral phrases like einkommensschwache Haushalte or bildungsferne Schichten. Studies show educational success in Germany depends strongly on social origin. Die Schicht also means layer and work shift. Plural: die Unterschichten."
